<style>
  @page { size: A4; margin: 0; }
  .page {
    width: 794px; height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px; box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden; page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child { page-break-after: auto; }
  table {
    width: 100%;
    border-collapse: collapse;
    margin-top: 15px;
    margin-bottom: 15px;
  }
  td, th {
    padding: 8px 0;
    text-align: left;
  }
  .header-section {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-weight: bold;
    margin-top: 20px;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
</style>
<div class="page">
  <div class="header-section">
    <h1 style="font-size: 18pt; text-align: center;">Colorado State University Department of Biochemistry</h1>
    <h2 style="font-size: 14pt; text-align: center;">BC 403-001/230 Comprehensive Biochemistry II - Metabolism</h2>
    <p style="text-align: center; margin-top: 5px;">Spring Semester {{ current_year }}</p>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-bottom: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>Instructor: <span data-field="instructor_name">{{ instructor_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Office: <span data-field="office_location">{{ office_location }}</span></p>
      <p>Phone: <span data-field="phone_number">{{ phone_number }}</span></p>
      <p>Email: <span data-field="email_address">{{ email_address }}</span></p>
      <p>Office hours: {{ office_hours }}</p>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <p>GTA: <span data-field="gta_name">{{ gta_name }}</span></p>
      <p>Email: <span data-field="gta_email">{{ gta_email }}</span></p>
      <p>Study Sessions: <span data-field="study_sessions">{{ study_sessions }}</span></p>
      <p>Location: <span data-field="location">{{ location }}</span></p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>Schedule: {{ schedule }}</p>
  <p>Prerequisites: {{ prerequisites }}</p>
  <p>Textbook: {{ textbook_info }}</p>

  <div class="section-title">Objectives:</div>
  <p>{{ objectives_description }}</p>

  <div class="section-title">Course Design:</div>
  <p>{{ course_design_description }}</p>

  <div class="section-title">Canvas:</div>
  <p>{{ canvas_intro }}</p>
  <ul>
    <li>a. <span data-field="canvas_course_home">{{ canvas_course_home }}</span></li>
    <li>b. <span data-field="canvas_announcement_details">{{ canvas_announcement_details }}</span></li>
    <li>i. <span data-field="canvas_announcement_details_i">{{ canvas_announcement_details_i }}</span></li>
  </ul>

  <div class="section-title">Modules:</div>
  <p>There are {{ num_modules }} modules in this class. The 1st module is the syllabus module that contains:</p>
  <ol>
    <li><span data-field="module_1_syllabus_content">{{ module_1_syllabus_content }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="module_2_syllabus_content">{{ module_2_syllabus_content }}</span></li>
    <li><span data-field="module_3_syllabus_content">{{ module_3_syllabus_content }}</span></li>
  </ol>
  <p>There is one "problem set" module that will contain all your problem sets in it. This module is directly below the syllabus module.</p>
  <p>There are {{ num_other_modules }} modules that correspond directly to a lecture within the course schedule. In each of these modules you will find:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>A powerpoint file for that modules set of lectures.</li>
    <li>Quizzes.</li>
    <li>There are {{ num_exam_materials }} exam study materials modules.</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="section-title">Quizzes:</div>
  <p>There will be {{ total_quizzes }} total quizzes in this class that will all be found on Canvas (in the lecture modules).</p>

  <div class="section-title">Grades:</div>
  <p>I will report the grades on all your assignments in this tool as well as your final grade.</p>
  <p>This page will take you to recordings of each day's lecture.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Attendance:</div>
  <p>{{ attendance_policy }}</p>

  <div class="section-title">Assignments:</div>
  <p>This class consists of {{ total_assignments }} assignments, and five in class group assignments ({{ group_assignment_count }} points) as detailed below:</p>
  <ol>
    <li>Quizzes – {{ quiz_points }} points</li>
    <li>Problem sets – {{ problem_set_points }} points</li>
    <li>Group Work Assignments – {{ group_work_points }} points</li>
    <li>Exams – {{ exam_points }} points</li>
  </ol>

  <div class="section-title">Grades:</div>
  <p>The four exams will constitute ~75% of the final grade. The quizzes and problem sets will constitute the remaining ~25% of the final grade. Final grades for the course will be assigned as follows:</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 30%;">Grade</th>
        <th style="width: 70%;">Final Average</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>A+</td>
        <td>97-100%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>A</td>
        <td>90-96%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>B+</td>
        <td>87-89%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>B</td>
        <td>80-86%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>C+</td>
        <td>77-79%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>C</td>
        <td>70-76%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>D</td>
        <td>60-69%</td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>F</td>
        <td>&lt;60%</td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>
  <p>If appropriate, the final averages required for a specific grade will be reduced to compensate for a low final class average or A- and B- grades may be used to better discriminate breaks in the grade distribution.</p>

  <div class="section-title">Grade Breakdown:</div>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 50%;">Assignment</th>
        <th style="width: 25%; text-align: center;">Points Counted</th>
        <th style="width: 25%;"></th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      <tr>
        <td>4 Exams ({{ exam_count }} points each)</td>
        <td style="text-align: center;">{{ total_exam_points }}</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>6 Problem sets (5-15 points each)</td>
        <td style="text-align: center;">{{ total_problem_set_points }}</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>5 Group Work Assignments</td>
        <td style="text-align: center;">{{ total_group_work_points }}</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td>13 quizzes (5 points each)</td>
        <td style="text-align: center;">{{ total_quiz_points }}</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
      <tr>
        <td style="font-weight: bold;">Total</td>
        <td style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold;">{{ grand_total_points }}</td>
        <td></td>
      </tr>
    </tbody>
  </table>

  <div class="section-title">Extra Credit:</div>
  <p>{{ extra_credit_description }}</p>

  <div class="section-title">Academic Integrity:</div>
  <p>{{ academic_integrity_policy }}</p>
  <p>End of the Semester: <span data-field="end_of_semester_note">{{ end_of_semester_note }}</span></p>

  <div class="section-title">Lecture Schedule</div>
  <p style="text-align: center; font-weight: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;">SUBJECT TO CHANGE</p>
  <table>
    <thead>
      <tr>
        <th style="width: 15%;">DATE</th>
        <th style="width: 15%;">DAY</th>
        <th style="width: 40%;">TOPIC</th>
        <th style="width: 30%;">TEXT READING</th>
      </tr>
    </thead>
    <tbody>
      {% for lecture in lecture_schedule %}
      <tr>
        <td>{{ lecture.date }}</td>
        <td>{{ lecture.day }}</td>
        <td>{{ lecture.topic }}</td>
        <td>{{ lecture.reading }}</td>
      </tr>
      {% endfor %}
    </tbody>
  </table>
</div>